<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/landing-page.css">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>USHLE</title>
</head>
<body>
    <div id="land-content">
        <h1>USHLE</h1>
        <p>Try to Guess The President</p>
        <form action="/play" method="get"><button id="playbutton">Play</button></form>
        <p>by Brian</p>
    </div>
    <div id="help-c">
        <button id="helpbutton">Help/Directions</button>
    </div>
    <div id="info-modal" class="modalx">
        <div class="modal-content">
            <span class="close">&times;</span>
            <p>How to play: <br><br>
                Guess the president within 5 guesses using the given categories<br><br>
                Decade: The decade in which a president started their presidential term<br><br>
                Era: General historical era at the time of presidency<br><br>
                Conflict: Potential ongoing armed/major conflict that the U.S. experienced at the time of presidency<br><br>
                Party: The political party that the president was associated with<br><br>
                # years: (Truncated) The number of years that a president was in office. <br><br>
                Colors: Green indicates that an answer has the correct property for a certain category. Red indicates that it is close. <br><br>
                If you are having a difficult time, you can use the hint button at the top. <br><br>
                For more info about your guess, you can click on the name of the president. <br><br>
                Otherwise, good luck!
            </p>
        </div>
    </div>
    <script src="/lp.js"></script>
</body>
</html>